    <string name="text_welcome_to_loan_day_as_a_professional_loan_platfor" formatted="false">Welcome to Loan Day. As a professional loan platform, we will strive to provide you with professional, convenient and multi-choice services and products. Therefore, when you use this platform, we need your authorization for the following data. After your authorization, we will analyze your application data for risk assessment and recommend suitable loan services and products for you. Your data will not be disclosed to any third party except with your permission. If you continue to use it, it will mean that you agree and accept our policy, if you refuse, you can still browse this platform, but you will not be able to apply for a loan.</string>
    
    <string name="text_user_privileges" formatted="false">User Privileges</string>
    
    <string name="text_camera_and_lmages_photos_nin_the_process_of_a_pply" formatted="false"><font color="#120d01"><b>Camera and Lmages &amp; Photos\n</b></font><font color="#120d01">In the process of a pplying for a loan, you need to authorize the use of photography, so that you can click on the photos of KYC documents and other necessary documents, which is a convenient experience for you. Therefore, we need camera, photo and file permissions. We also need to obtain your image information to analyze your financial situation and assess the risk of fraud. This will speed up your application process.</font>
    </string>
    
    <string name="text_location_nwe_need_your_authorization_to_allow_us_t" formatted="false"><font color="#120d01"><b>Location\n</b></font><font color="#120d01">We need your authorization to allow us to collect the location information of your equipment and know your real location, so as to ensure that you are within the scope of our services, so as to reduce the risk of your loan application.</font>
    </string>
    
