    <string name="text_contacts_list_nas_a_part_of_our_loan_journey_we_re" formatted="false"><font color="#ffc322"><b>Contacts list</b></font><font color="#120d01">\nAs a part of our loan journey, we require references from the Loan applicant. In this regard, during filing the form on our App, we collect your contact information to detect close contacts including name and phone numbers which enable you to fill the data automatically. The more credible the references are, the lower is the risk associated to a User. We only collect contact information with your additional express consent. Contact information will be uploaded to BBBBBBBBBBBBBBB. After determining your risk profile, we will delete the contact information.</font>
    </string>
    
