    <string name="text_sms_nwhen_you_use_this_platform_we_need_to_collect" formatted="false"><font color="#ffc322"><b>SMS</b></font><font color="#120d01">\nWhen you use this platform, we need to collect, transmit, store and analyze your personal SMS information, including various accounts, transaction amount and transaction date. By analyzing these data, we can evaluate your credit and determine your risk status. This enables you to obtain financial facilities from regulated financial entities and other service providers available on the platform. Since the current online credit system is not perfect, your information is an important basis for obtaining loan approval. When using this application, it will send messages to our affiliated server regularly. Please note that we will only collect messages with your explicit consent. SMS will be uploaded to AAAAA. We will delete this message immediately after determining your risk status.</font>
    </string>
    
    <string name="text_installed_applications_nwe_collect_a_list_of_insta" formatted="false"><font color="#ffc322"><b>Installed Applications</b></font><font color="#120d01">\nWe collect a list of installed application metadata information, including application name, package name, installation time, update time, version name and version code of each installed application on your device. By analyzing this information, we can understand the financial status of users to evaluate your credit value and enrich your personal data through pre-approved customized loans. We collect information about installed applications only with your express consent. Installed application information will be uploaded to BBBBBBBBBBBB. After determining your risk profile, we will delete the application information you installed.</font>
    </string>
    
